    "rationale": "Manual validation only; scripts could not be run in this environment. Reviewed artifacts show a present untrusted-to-S3 path where external vendor quote content can set bank details that are delegated to payments-agent for irreversible payment, with no structural control binding payee details to a trusted record. A second present risk is authority laundering because manager approval covers only item and budget before quotes exist and does not propagate to the delegated payment task. The most consequential missing control is structural approval-context propagation and trusted recipient confirmation on cap.delegate_payment. Assessment reflects declared design and configuration, not observed runtime behavior."
